@AdminApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5166

### 1. Get all adopted areas (public, no auth)
GET {{AdminApi_HostAddress}}/api/public/areas
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Register a new volunteer (public, no auth)
POST {{AdminApi_HostAddress}}/api/public/volunteers/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Volunteer",
  "phoneNo": "0271112222",
  "emailAddress": "testvolunteer@example.com",
  "requestedAreaName": "Dee Street"
}

###

### 3. Register an admin account (only needed once, if you don't have one yet)
POST {{AdminApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "email": "admin1@southalive.org.nz",
  "password": "ChangeThisPassword123!",
  "role": "Admin"
}

###

### 4. Login as admin — copy the returned token for the next requests
POST {{AdminApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "password": "ChangeThisPassword123!"
}

###

### 5. Get all volunteers (admin, requires auth token from step 4)
GET {{AdminApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/volunteeradmin
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..4OyrEIuDHOR2IrQKa01PgZH2Szt3xWQmNzKdIPrVacs
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Get only pending volunteers
GET {{AdminApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/volunteeradmin?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Approve a volunteer (replace {id} with the actual volunteer_id from step 2/6)
PATCH {{AdminApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/volunteeradmin/4/approve
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "areaName": "Dee Street",
  "areaType": "street",
  "geometryGeoJson": "{\"type\":\"LineString\",\"coordinates\":[[168.3600,-46.4150],[168.3650,-46.4155]]}"
}

###

### 8. Reject a volunteer (use a different pending volunteer's id)
PATCH {{AdminApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/volunteeradmin/5/reject
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

###